<h1>Agents can inspect why a turn started</h1>
<p>The new <code>wake_reason</code> tool tells the model what started its current turn, including chat and webhook input or scheduled work. {{ release.tag }} also fixes GitHub pull-request review deliveries. Neither change requires new configuration.</p>
